@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Ring Design — Select, Configure or Submit Reference Image
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest or Member|
start
:Choose design approach;
if (Approved ring model?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Load Manager-approved model;
  :Mark route as catalogue design;
  stop
elseif (Component configurator?) then (yes)
  |Member|
  :Choose available component options;
  |System|
  :Validate against approved components\nand hard constraints;
  if (Selection valid?) then (yes)
    :Mark route as configured design;
  else (no)
    :Explain constraint and require a valid selection;
  endif
  stop
else (Custom design request)
  if (Signed-in Member?) then (yes)
    :Describe the ring and/or attach reference images;
    :Give image-processing consent;
    |System|
    :Validate content, consent, images and rate limit;
  if (Request accepted?) then (yes)
    :Create Need Review request;
    |Staff or Manager|
    :Review the request;
    |System|
    :Record Accepted, Rejected or Clarification Required\nwith actor, explanation, version and audit context;
  else (no)
    :Show consent / validation error;
  endif
  else (Guest)
    :Prompt sign-in;
  endif
endif

note right
Only a Member can submit a request. Staff or Manager decides by hand; no AI is used.
end note
stop
@enduml
